{"name":"Puffball","hex":"#ccbfc9","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"puffball","whole":true,"parts":[{"part":"Noun","definitions":["Any of various fungi, usually globose, that produce a cloud of brown dust-like spores from their mature fruiting bodies, especially in family Lycoperdaceae.","Any of various mushrooms with globose fruiting bodies."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/puffball"}],"entries":[{"title":"Puffball","blocks":[{"text":"Puffballs are a type of fungus featuring a ball-shaped fruiting body that, when mature, bursts on contact or impact, releasing a cloud of dust-like spores into the surrounding area. Puffballs belong to the division Basidiomycota and encompass several genera, including Calvatia, Calbovista and Lycoperdon. The puffballs were previously treated as a taxonomic group called the Gasteromycetes or Gasteromycetidae, but they are now known to be a polyphyletic assemblage."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/4/47/Flaschenst%C3%A4ubling.jpg/330px-Flaschenst%C3%A4ubling.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puffball","wikidata":"Q1759052"},{"title":"Puffball (film)","blocks":[{"text":"Puffball is a 2007 supernatural horror-thriller film directed by Nicolas Roeg, his final feature before his death in 2018. The script was adapted from Fay Weldon's 1980 novel of the same name by her son, Dan Weldon. The film was partially funded through the UK Film Council's New Cinema Fund. The film had its premiere at the Transilvania International Film Festival on 3 June 2007. The film was later released in Canada on 28 October 2007, and saw a limited release in the United States on 29 February 2008."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/7/77/Puffball_%28film%29.jpg/330px-Puffball_%28film%29.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Puffball_(film)","wikidata":"Q1439591"}],"images":[{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Calbovista_subsculpta_45731.jpg/500px-Calbovista_subsculpta_45731.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Calbovista_subsculpta_45731.jpg/1280px-Calbovista_subsculpta_45731.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 2x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/6/6d/Calbovista_subsculpta_45731.jpg/500px-Calbovista_subsculpta_45731.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACalbovista_subsculpta_45731.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Calvatia_cyathiformis_3.JPG/500px-Calvatia_cyathiformis_3.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/c/c6/Calvatia_cyathiformis_3.JPG/500px-Calvatia_cyathiformis_3.JPG?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3ACalvatia_cyathiformis_3.JPG"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Puffball_fungai.jpg/500px-Puffball_fungai.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x","src":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/12/Puffball_fungai.jpg/500px-Puffball_fungai.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail","alt":"Cloud of spores poofs out of a puffball fungus","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/File%3APuffball_fungai.jpg"},{"srcset":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/6e/Puffball_Mushrooms_On_Sale.jpg/500px-Puffball_Mushrooms_On_Sale.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=parser&utm_content=thumbnail 1x, https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/thumb/6/6e/Puffball_Mushrooms_O